Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:41:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] jane: decoder log-probability per hypothesis (Backend.Scored)
 - tie-break among equally severe hard candidates, low-confidence flag hook;
 runner/JaneEval protocol extended (backward compatible)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
